# Step 01: walking skeleton

## Goal

A deployed API with the three basic endpoints, so that the web app can start using it.

## Scope

- `POST /notes`, `GET /notes`, `DELETE /notes/{id}`.
- Deployment on the host from [the hosting decision](../decisions/infrastructure/2026-11-02-hosting-on-fly-io.md).

## Acceptance criteria

1. The three endpoints answer on the deployed URL.
2. Deleting a note follows the [soft delete decision](../decisions/api/2026-11-02-soft-delete.md).

## Log

- 2026-11-02: Started; endpoints sketched.
- Then `DELETE /notes/{id}` with soft delete; checked with the tests of the endpoint.
  - Deployment still open.
-- .brain/steps/02-sharing.md --
---
description: "Notes shared with other users."
---
# Step 02: sharing

## Goal

Users share a note with other users.

## Scope

Sharing by email address.

## Acceptance criteria

1. A shared note is visible to the other user.
